    the age as of date of *a value* and *a second value* is *a third value*.
    the invoke decision service of *a value* and *a second value* and *a third value* and *a fourth value* is *a fifth value*.
    the spouse id of *a value* and *a second value* is *a third value*.

the knowledge base bdt includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/BDT.dmn".

